      {
        "id": "textbook-clipping-definition",
        "moduleId": "clip-problem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：什么是裁剪",
        "markdown": "一般情况下，任何用来消除指定区域内或区域外图形部分的过程都称为裁剪算法（clipping algorithm），简称裁剪（clipping）。裁剪区域理论上可以是任意形状，但实际应用中通常采用**正则矩形**作为裁剪窗口，因为它便于用四条边界的不等式统一判断。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000282"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "裁剪算法"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7498,
              "lineEnd": 7521,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "f2020ace44149c2581ce0df087c0f8aa260e49f8445fda345ca5e8e3de3b1090"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-intuition-viewfinder",
        "moduleId": "clip-problem",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充直觉：把裁剪想成取景框",
        "markdown": "可以把裁剪想成用取景框拍照：框外的景物不会进入照片，框内的部分保持原样。裁剪改变的是“显示哪些部分”，并不重新定义图形本身。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-clipping-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-misconception-partial",
        "moduleId": "clip-problem",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "模型补充：裁剪不等于删除整个对象",
        "markdown": "常见误解是“裁剪就是把整个对象删除”。实际上，线段和多边形可以与窗口边界求交，只保留窗口内部的那一段或那一块；被完全包含的对象原样保留，只有完全位于窗口外的对象才整体剔除。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-clipping-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-clip-region",
        "moduleId": "clip-problem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材约定：正则矩形裁剪区域",
        "markdown": "除非特别声明，裁剪区域取正则矩形，其边界为 $xw_{\\mathrm{min}}$、$xw_{\\mathrm{max}}$、$yw_{\\mathrm{min}}$、$yw_{\\mathrm{max}}$。这些边界与 $x$、$y$ 取值范围为 0 到 1 或 -1 到 1 的规范化正方形边界相对应。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
